Pornography the wizard started with, among other things, a ring of
slow digestion, a magic marker and a spellbook of charm monster. 
Kittie the kitten soon fell to a falling rock trap, but she was
replaced by Jag the jaguar.

Flash forward to Minetown (the Grotto Town version.)  Izchak had two
magic lamps, both blessed; Pornography used one for a blessed SDSM and
the other for lighting.  A few charm monster spells gave him a huge
army of pets.  The local temple was coaligned.  Some holy water, a
couple of paper golems, the magic marker and some price-IDing resulted
in an ample supply of identify scrolls.  Things were looking good for
Pornography.

However, with all the carnivorous pets (soldier ants and vampire bats
mainly), as well as his low strength, it was hard to find anything to
sacrifice for Magicbane.  Even with his myriad benefits, Pornography
was wielding a standard dagger.

Pornography headed down to the lower levels with a couple soldier
ants, burdened with his bounty.  Soon he found and killed a
chickatrice.  Thanks to the gloves he had "inherited" from a watchman
killed by his pets, Pornography hefted up the corpse and brought it
back to Minetown.  After fighting his way through his former pets,
Pornography walked up to the guard captain.  His command decimated by
a horde of tame soldier ants, the captain remained valiant
nevertheless, his level too high for any pets to touch him, and his
treasures securely on his person.

Checking to make sure his gloves were securely on, Pornography drew
the corpse from his backpack and crept up on the guard captain.  He
missed... several times.  DYWYPI?

